//   - ENCRYPTION_STATE_UNSPECIFIED: Unstamped/legacy rows that predate CMEK. Treated as PLAINTEXT.
//   - ENCRYPTION_STATE_PLAINTEXT: Customer-data artifacts are stored as plaintext (Fireworks-owned, no CMEK).
